{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的 S08 只有 20 秒，却安排了四句叙述和多组感受，扫读压力明显高于 X；S09 又把“怕孤单”推成“连那些气也肯再受”，对人物动机的解释略显武断。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的关键心理转折有明显的视觉落点，普通观众不必逐字读完，也能抓住人物每一阶段的核心变化。感受文字与音乐进程结合得更紧，身体反应、音乐质感和人物心理之间有具体联系，使从离开、怀念、动摇到最终带着想念继续生活的过程更连贯，也更有细节层次。X 的优势是左右分栏、短词扫读直接，但情绪标签有时堆叠而缺少主次，人物心理的推进不如 Y 清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b51d29d7-c80e-461d-a323-472ce09fd02e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022344656644Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:24:39.665739+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2cabcb2175382b9563aef6eb13533f5a2ceed253248b28bacf08139faf42e5b7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp